  "views": {
    "front": "Clear two-module left-chaise silhouette, separate plump back cushions, broad seat faces, padded arms and recessed timber feet. Both blue-grey tint and dimensions match the preserved baseline.",
    "rear": "Two separate upholstered rear panels align with the transport-module split; the back cushions have depth and rake. Wood feet and consistent outer arm construction remain visible.",
    "underside": "Two inset dust covers, perimeter wood support rails and eight recessed feet form a coherent closed upholstery underside. Cushion boxing remains continuous around the chaise edge.",
    "clay": "Shaped backs, broad settled seats, rounded arm caps and narrow seams remain visible without texture. The long chaise cover widens around the arm nose, avoiding a large empty deck ledge.",
    "detail": "Visible sewn boxing and localized corner tension survive export. Fine woven surface remains deliberately subtle at furniture distance, with restrained matte highlights rather than the baseline full-white sheen."
  },
